en-us


  Acme status page moves to a new address
  https://status.acme.example/notices/moved
  The status page now lives at status.acme.example.
  {{now | dateModify "-3h" | date "Mon, 02 Jan 2006 15:04:05 -0700"}}
  https://status.acme.example/notices/moved

{{- if fileExists "/published/first"}}


  Acme database outage in eu-west
  https://status.acme.example/incidents/1
  Writes to the eu-west database fail. We are investigating.
  {{now | dateModify "-1m" | date "Mon, 02 Jan 2006 15:04:05 -0700"}}
  https://status.acme.example/incidents/1

{{- end}}
{{- if fileExists "/published/second"}}


  Acme API outage in us-east
  https://status.acme.example/incidents/2
  The us-east API answers with errors. We are investigating.
  {{now | dateModify "-1m" | date "Mon, 02 Jan 2006 15:04:05 -0700"}}
  https://status.acme.example/incidents/2

{{- end}}
